<Positioned left="460.00" top="628.00" width="260.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="15" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Serif CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">薄层几乎全由冰晶组成</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="460.00" top="656.00" width="260.00" height="46.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="10.5" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">日面高时整层从不厚到能挡住地面物影；晕几乎必然出现，是卷层云在场的明确证据</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="760.00" top="628.00" width="250.00" height="44.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="11.5" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">霾貌似卷层云，但其独特黄/褐色可区分</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="760.00" top="674.00" width="250.00" height="30.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="10.5" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">乳状薄雾（或薄层云）的乳白幕 vs 卷层云：看有无晕、看颜色</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="726" width="960" height="300"><Container width="960" height="300" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E3DAC6"/></Positioned>
