<Positioned left="392.00" top="836.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· undulatus 波状卷层云（幕面起伏）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="392.00" top="862.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· duplicatus 复卷层云（叠置两层）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="392.00" top="888.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#B9C4CE" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">—</Text></Container></Positioned>
