<Positioned left="86.00" top="1096.00" width="460.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 见晕 → 卷层云在场的明确证据（晕见于日月穿薄冰晶幕）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="86.00" top="1124.00" width="460.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 日高角 ＞30° 时地面物影仍可辨；低于 30° 光路长、影弱难见</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="86.00" top="1152.00" width="460.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 外观与厚度随时间变化很小，显得移动缓慢</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="560.00" top="1096.00" width="440.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 民谚「日晕三更雨」：晕示锋面接近，12–36 h 内雨（Meteo.es）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="560.00" top="1124.00" width="440.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 与薄层云/霾之别：卷层云见晕、无色偏；霾带黄或褐色</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="560.00" top="1152.00" width="440.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 与卷云之别：卷层云为连续薄幕、可蔽全天；卷云不连续</Text></Container></Positioned>
